WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.047 --> 00:00:04.672
The Demon of Mighty Roots squeezed tightly.

2
00:00:04.673 --> 00:00:08.750
Cozlin and Wukong struggled against the thick, strong branches.

3
00:00:08.751 --> 00:00:12.806
Roxy stared intensely at the branch wrapped around her waist.

4
00:00:12.807 --> 00:00:15.826
Orange beams radiated from her eyes.

5
00:00:15.827 --> 00:00:22.859
"Ouch! What is that?" The demon looked down and saw smoke rising from the branch.

6
00:00:22.860 --> 00:00:28.735
"Stop that!" he shouted. "You're burning—"

7
00:00:28.736 --> 00:00:32.535
Fwoomf! The branch burst into flames.

8
00:00:32.536 --> 00:00:37.310
The Demon of Mighty Roots dropped his captives and splashed into the river.

9
00:00:37.311 --> 00:00:44.223
Hiss! Steam rose into the sky.

10
00:00:44.224 --> 00:00:47.858
The demon swung a branch, knocking Roxy and Cozlin backward.

11
00:00:47.859 --> 00:00:50.793
Wukong swung his iron bar.

12
00:00:50.794 --> 00:00:54.652
Crack! The demon's tree trunk body cracked.

13
00:00:54.653 --> 00:01:00.456
"No!" The demon fell to the ground, unable to move.

14
00:01:00.457 --> 00:01:03.378
Roxy and Cozlin hurried over.

15
00:01:03.379 --> 00:01:06.569
"Nice work, Wukong!" Roxy said.

16
00:01:06.570 --> 00:01:09.144
Cozlin pumped her fist in the air.

17
00:01:09.145 --> 00:01:11.974
Wukong grinned. "Watch this!"

18
00:01:11.975 --> 00:01:14.120
He raised his iron bar over his head.

19
00:01:14.121 --> 00:01:18.777
But as it swung backward, it hit Cozlin's wrist.

20
00:01:18.778 --> 00:01:24.776
Voop! The portal opened, pulling her, Roxy, and Wukong through.

21
00:01:24.777 --> 00:01:28.303
Bam! Roxy landed on a hard floor.

22
00:01:28.304 --> 00:01:31.437
Cozlin and Wukong landed next to her.

23
00:01:31.438 --> 00:01:34.838
They were back in the portal laboratory on Hulzar.

24
00:01:34.839 --> 00:01:41.538
Flix looked relieved. "I'm glad you're back! I was getting worried."

25
00:01:41.539 --> 00:01:45.661
"Where are we?" Wukong asked, looking around.

26
00:01:45.662 --> 00:01:48.174
"I was just about to destroy the demon!"

27
00:01:48.175 --> 00:01:51.619
"We're on a planet—Hulzar," Roxy said.

28
00:01:51.620 --> 00:01:55.420
"This is where we got the portal to find you."

29
00:01:55.421 --> 00:02:02.544
Flix was wringing his hands. "Meltron's robots have taken over more planets.

30
00:02:02.545 --> 00:02:06.979
They even attacked Hulzar.

31
00:02:06.980 --> 00:02:10.363
Luckily we can all hide deep inside the planet.

32
00:02:10.364 --> 00:02:14.307
The only way to get down here is with one of our portals."

33
00:02:14.308 --> 00:02:16.929
Another Hulzarian hurried over.

34
00:02:16.930 --> 00:02:21.673
"I have bad news, Flix. The robots have started drilling into the ground."

35
00:02:21.674 --> 00:02:26.292
Flix gasped. "We can't let them reach us!

36
00:02:26.293 --> 00:02:31.838
If they get our portal technology, they'll be able to go anywhere in the galaxy."

37
00:02:31.839 --> 00:02:37.771
"We don't have much time," Cozlin said. "We have to stop Meltron now!"

38
00:02:37.772 --> 00:02:42.967
"No!" Wukong said. "I have to get back to my own world!

39
00:02:42.968 --> 00:02:46.856
I was about to destroy the Demon of Mighty Roots!

40
00:02:46.857 --> 00:02:52.058
If I don't do that, he'll eat the Tang Monk! I can't let that happen!"

41
00:02:52.059 --> 00:02:56.697
Roxy bit her lip. She knew Wukong's journey was important.

42
00:02:56.698 --> 00:02:59.393
But they had an important mission here too.

43
00:02:59.394 --> 00:03:02.258
The entire galaxy was in danger.

44
00:03:02.259 --> 00:03:08.586
Roxy looked at Cozlin. "What should we do? We told Wukong we'd help him."

45
00:03:08.587 --> 00:03:12.842
"I know," Cozlin said. "But . . ."

46
00:03:12.843 --> 00:03:15.733
"What's the problem?" Flix asked.

47
00:03:15.734 --> 00:03:21.037
Wukong took a deep breath. "I was about to destroy a demon.

48
00:03:21.038 --> 00:03:24.910
But then we wound up here. I need to get back quickly."

49
00:03:24.911 --> 00:03:28.077
"Oh, is that all?" Flix asked.

50
00:03:28.078 --> 00:03:30.781
"I can adjust the portal projector.

51
00:03:30.782 --> 00:03:35.497
When you return home, it will make you arrive at the exact moment you left.

52
00:03:35.498 --> 00:03:39.437
That way no time will have gone by."

53
00:03:39.438 --> 00:03:43.940
Roxy was shocked. "You can do that?"

54
00:03:43.941 --> 00:03:49.627
"Of course," Flix said. "Can't you do that on your planet?"

55
00:03:49.628 --> 00:03:52.718
"Um, no," Roxy said.

56
00:03:52.719 --> 00:03:56.897
Flix shrugged. "That's strange."

57
00:03:56.898 --> 00:04:00.479
"Strange, you," Bippo said to Roxy.

58
00:04:00.480 --> 00:04:04.882
Roxy frowned. "That's not nice, Bippo."

59
00:04:04.883 --> 00:04:08.612
"Sorry, me."

60
00:04:08.613 --> 00:04:11.303
Wukong was smiling.

61
00:04:11.304 --> 00:04:21.625
"This will be like a little vacation for me. I was hoping for some excitement!"

